      {
        "id": "D2",
        "justificacion": {
          "en": "CA SB 1120, TX SB 815, AI Act art. 14; the app's hard rule. Approving in part (up to the service's cap, RB-08) is a partial adverse determination: Texas forbids it automated, so Texas mode sends it to a person; without it, it goes out on its own. A full denial always goes to a person.",
